FR:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Aujourd'hui, c'est la fête des œufs !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Je vais me faire une omelette
géante pour l'occasion !

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Heut ist {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Häschentag{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!!!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich werd bestimmt 'ne
Tonne Eier verputzen!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Did you see {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Zipper T. Bunny{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} yet?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}When you get close to him, this
music starts playing,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Has visto por ahí a {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Coti Conejal{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Cuando se acerca suena como
una musiquita,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Hai già incontrato {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Ovidio{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Si sente sempre una musica quando
lui è nei paraggi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Zipper T. Bunny{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}'yi gördün mü?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Yanına yaklaşınca birden müzik çalmaya
başlıyor,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
I thought I'd caught a rare fish.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}But it turns out it was an egg!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Some pretty weird stuff can happen
on {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Bunny Day{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Le he dado un golpe a una piedra{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
y ha salido un huevo!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Intenté hincarle el diente, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}pero vaya
si estaba duro, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
¡Como la piedra de la que salió!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I was shaking this fruitless tree,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
and an egg fell out!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}A tree that grows eggs!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} What a
find,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Meyvesiz bir ağacı sallıyordum,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} içinden
yumurta düştü!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Yumurta yetiştiren ağaç!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
İşte buna keşif derim,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I was taking a walk on the beach,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
and I saw an egg in the water,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}I bet you could probably dive for
it, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Me estaba comiendo un huevo y
me he encontrado una cosa dentro.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Es bonita y brilla, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Prima ho dato un morso a un uovo
e ho trovato qualcosa dentro...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Che bella sorpresa, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Als ich vorhin ein Ei gegessen hab,
hab ich was drin gefunden! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Was Wunderschönes, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
